{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"732919665235591169","content":"Kiln walks into the shop. \"Hullo there, was told this was tha place ta buy things?\"\n\nJack turns to the new customer \"Gwuag!\"\n\n\"Yer a big fellow aren't ye?\"\n\nJack rolls his big inky eyes. \"Gwuag...what want-rl?\"\n\n\"Looking fer sometin ta match wit this here yklwa.\" She holds up the Gold and Blue spiraled pointed rod.\n\nJack looks at the rod for a moment. \"Osiris-rl?\"\n\n\"Ah, ye know o O, do ye?\"\n\n\"Gwuag! Only things certain-rl Death-rl and Taxes-rl.\" With a wink he opens his maw and a crooked rod protrudes from his gullet.\n\nKiln uncomfortably reaches forward and takes the Crooked Rod. \"Eh, how much?\"\n\nJack closes his mouth and burps up three large bubbles. \"Fellow of Osiris-rl, discount.\" \n\n\"Eh...s'at 300gp?\"\n\n\"Gwuag!\"\n\nShe holds out the 300g to Jack, soon regretting it. Jack engulfs the small dwarves hand, sucking down the coin. \n\n\"Wuh...tha...fuck...\" Kiln takes the staff and walks out of the shop.","created_at":"2020-07-25T00:01:24.279000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736372496390946836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
